# ==========================================================================
# KIARIT PHARMACEUTICALS — redirects (Cloudflare Workers static assets)
#
# Replaces the mod_rewrite block in .htaccess. Cloudflare handles HTTPS and
# the apex/www choice at the DNS and SSL layer, so neither belongs here.
#
# The site uses clean URLs (/about, not /about.html). The .html -> clean
# redirect is produced automatically by "html_handling": "drop-trailing-slash"
# in wrangler.jsonc, so writing those rules here as well would create a
# redirect loop. Only genuine aliases belong in this file.
#
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# ==========================================================================

# Friendly aliases people are likely to type or that may appear in print.
/shop  /products  301
/buy   /order     301
/home  /          301

# Old .html URLs -> clean URLs, permanently.
# Cloudflare's html_handling would already do this, but it answers 307
# (temporary), which does not pass ranking signals. _redirects is evaluated
# before html_handling, so these 301s win and search engines are told the
# move is permanent. These point .html -> clean, the SAME direction as
# html_handling, so they cannot loop.
/index.html             /                   301
/about.html             /about              301
/products.html          /products           301
/product-1.html         /product-1          301
/product-2.html         /product-2          301
/product-3.html         /product-3          301
/product-4.html         /product-4          301
/product-5.html         /product-5          301
/contact.html           /contact            301
/order.html             /order              301
/privacy-policy.html    /privacy-policy     301
/terms.html             /terms              301
/shipping-returns.html  /shipping-returns   301
/disclaimer.html        /disclaimer         301
